        content: "AI creates unprecedented opportunities for student entrepreneurs.\n\n**Why Now?**\n- AI APIs make it possible to build powerful products without PhD-level knowledge\n- Low barrier to entry: API call = AI capability\n- Massive market demand across every industry\n- First-mover advantage in many niches\n\n**Product Categories:**\n\n**1. AI Wrappers (Easiest)**\nBuild a specialized interface on top of existing AI APIs.\n- Custom ChatGPT for specific industries\n- AI-powered tools for niche workflows\n- Example: Jasper AI (marketing copy), Copy.ai, Otter.ai\n\n**2. AI-Enhanced Existing Products**\nAdd AI features to traditional software.\n- E-commerce with AI recommendations\n- CRM with AI-powered insights\n- Analytics with natural language queries\n\n**3. AI-Native Products**\nProducts that couldn't exist without AI.\n- AI video generation (Sora, Runway)\n- AI code assistants (Copilot, Cursor)\n- AI tutoring systems\n\n**Finding Your Idea:**\n1. What pain points do you experience as a student?\n2. What manual processes could AI automate?\n3. What existing tools lack AI capabilities?\n4. What's too expensive that AI could make affordable?\n\n**Validation Checklist:**\n- Do people actually have this problem? (Talk to 10 potential users)\n- Are they willing to pay for a solution?\n- Can you build an MVP in 2-4 weeks?\n- Is the AI technology reliable enough for this use case?",
